Recall data
The recall notices in data/ are collected from public government sources
and remain subject to those sources' own licences and terms, for example
the Open Government Licence – Canada, the UK Open Government Licence,
Licence Ouverte / Etalab and the European Commission's reuse policy.
Frostinn ehf. claims no ownership of that information. Each recall page
links to its official source.

